  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12d806507f2a81b05ebd03d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爆辣对决！黄金船吐了什么东西出来！\n腹肌对决！一分钟一百下！果然还是吐了！\n双方拿出全力抗衡，比赛僵持不下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef9ce78ab2dad4a500a52d57e8c1f93716ea2506ed4393893b614f6154f569e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83e9af21c9b961a2b7961480",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员在一旁看着她们进行\n最后的化身铜像对决。\n众目睽睽之下，黄金船获得了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aa7ea5fadd280411aeaf9354335f351aa2107a28bcdc60cdc97058ecfe51b54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afd180081eaa19b419127610",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回程路上，\n黄金船告诉训练员她在梦里被叫去找伊甸园。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4783d46c32c7183ee975c0cada84d0ac690b978ab93a8b28b27ca27e2b644fe3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c402bad4ecc0edc7c20f883",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦境跟伊甸园到底有什么关系呢？\n训练员抱持着疑问，\n而黄金船则是抛下了他全力奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4242bc41262d292cfea336b215e727237e1cd3f23105c2c5f3e24a81e1d77c47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59fd8f20aa521b01278d487f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "认真对战篇",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1099012b130ef7e89af4c1a45a5de41381987cd2d4f69aae0741e718ec1d224",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e830db1a29802ecb6daf228",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船打倒无数劲敌，\n终于得到了前往伊甸园的资格。\n而在那里等着她的是秋川理事长。不意外！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8973fd1b6a6f7d0837bf40184b69116fdb1a385aa28d14a943cb5efb22dc2936",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1814735a2914fcfc0a4b0b9e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秘传之书其实是秋川理事长\n为了让黄金船拿出干劲而拟定的计划。\n而所谓伊甸园就是赛马娘所建造的理想乡──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6791e8d0d0fa513809369e865c6d25f6833481314f069bb346032e6b5d12530c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:316515b3db7451607ffe4530",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是闪耀系列赛。\n换句话说，她早就抵达了伊甸园。\n但是秋川理事长似乎与梦境没有关系。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94f5fa08b70e740738cc5d83d27f4297a1e764d551159ad65d3363873f2d4a99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42c9be87066f7c4c4b74c107",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那段梦境的声音究竟是怎么回事？\n只要黄金船沿着金色的航线继续前进，\n或许总有一天会得到答案吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6e7862099161bc14953ad4ca435ab123d3882521fd5d13592a88ab21ec2291",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31d4ba5020a0cc5759bdf254",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "通往伊甸园的道路",
      "source_fingerprint": "0028954b52979c76d3716032e392374bdeaa0f9ca505ebac9f4eb31adf9e547b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5517dab59ee9f2cb3c7cbfc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“夏季集训”从今天开始。\n黄金船想到可能触发学园外的隔宿事件，\n情绪已经抵达MAX的最高潮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c61dd8a5a393b67fbdd82435ad5314b4dc5a27c9d8bc80b3254f3c7d05d5bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0725ca95f7f44c3f4445bb1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而正所谓世事无常……\n结果她搞到筋疲力尽，在移动途中就睡着了。\n沙滩就在眼前了啊！黄金船，Stand Up！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1777fa8b4a41b99dc2ed41df9fef2707596711619b568e6c81870b68ebf7d3d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24888c2039e69aeadeb2445b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第2年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "225375376c5fdf8404800f01bfae8c6ed9a9204cddd553a5978ed5b2c0cbe9a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b1fbf31e899475ba54c5971",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年也到了夏季集训的时节。\n黄金船对去年的状况有所反省，\n今年决定压抑自己的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6915453aaeef8931bdf48a826d3279b818e5df79fa15d64822b35d66dff736ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4019426a5f6ff0e6d797bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而青春期的冲动是残酷的。\n黄金船今年也睡死了！\n于是她就这样在梦中迎接了夏季集训的到来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f06a674566485fa2d1e6afa7c7f043b81f8a82a0e9b4de0c55b7a9f161281ffd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b69040a0e61b963dfcc24c91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第3年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2018daecd587b3acd573214a2b2c9e4607f1262610f0ce7cb9324e673d98a91d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5ef3fa6430de36fd150dd4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船终于从探索伊甸园的旅程归来，\n勉强赶上了出道战。\n但她在竞赛开始前──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba4d8c750a7d94485f784e160bf716fa3ce2aa8bdfbf20c1590ae06f664dd2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d189826a08f447b48d5ec99b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──居然在透过竹轮观察吉娃娃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6bbf4a946a708f25893fb63db2d11ba551cf5d07ae0a5a1708a13b23301b940",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a242c728437d16d775548a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她到底能不能在比赛中发挥实力？\n训练员感受到一丝不安，但也只能\n一边暗地祈祷，一边目送她前往参加出道战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0dd6b8741307a91361d7bf0049de5e355289dec9dad94f1ceeecaeff2f37fe7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a95532f1ef0dec86c74ab585",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f499d5fbe21a3d94a01fc9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一天，黄金船化身大海上的一只蝴蝶。\n祖传的蝶式可说是所向无敌。\n然而“希望锦标”是陆上竞技啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc0db65b58399ef83e64b8534cccc87d289be573dbde3591670ca7b42cd13ea8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f7d4de9236eb4aa34443d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，太平洋仍在等待着她。\n以跨越海沟的气势冲过终点线吧，黄金船！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15e6041ea620629df447fe2674ef8a605a817352ed6d1836f1416da5884bf333",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e403ed4bd16b27c49bd0b97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向希望S",
      "source_fingerprint": "adb373f200cb49f40c02297528eb2737067be5c594bb1c8cfce7e8afaa072465",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d38a343794ae83eb38c5ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典级首战“皋月赏”当天，\n黄金船非常暴躁。明明是四月却叫做\n“皋月赏”，不可原谅！……好像是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1de70254c0b89290ba451c7e8675098cfd61ec39945c7609772c0f219a1bd24f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cc4160d12dab124278c9fbf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船朝着莫名其妙的方向冲刺，\n一心要获得这场胜利，\n并决心把“皋月赏”正名为“卯月赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb43be6442c26fcd8567dac06ce592958d3ab31a0ec3f39994c280ffe4a3470",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da8158894ef30fc8008bd425",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向皋月赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ff224a61598a6c666007568d7268968b6f324292cc2eee89e3b5acc428c30a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2d3e5bcd498f9a4a0db773c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面临经典赛中距离最长的“菊花赏”，\n黄金船反而极度放松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daac2df76d5e8d6ea197bd4b3839208a7b74ec15bec133089ed99947136c179b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d486a889c51776382172fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "又是喝茶，又是嚼仙贝的──\n呃，真的没问题吗……咦？\n训练员对正式比赛感到极度不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f5d510279c7ac5a70601dfe59b196646e5f623723a4684fd33421488b21fe07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54533785e7b218f517ca89de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向菊花赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32fe703b345a297a6972e4f3115aec53ea8a9931382257ccb6b146928c5537e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a659400c6d31e860dac503a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为百条花枝赌上生命，目标是丰收的钓师魂。\n潮汐的交界处不容相让，胜负可谓波涛汹涌。\n恳请各位细心观赏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1b45dadce106566de4c5b6c60dde58caea016063157caf53665577e1790465",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1218f1d4d76919c3ee774d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这就是由黄金船主演的“有马纪念”！\n……黄金船不知道为什么变成了钓师，\n对荣进闪耀燃起了斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c8aa3e10218afd468477cd2f6039388f7ad6bed948990fae6c3752ec6f6633",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf428c243bb881b4c6b2df14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167b90e9249ee15be964c86e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（春）”是今年的目标竞赛之一。\n然而黄金船的状况\n却（一如往常地）很奇怪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17158558cd5758e35b07c7db87df8ce8d7004674927213bea5daecaef4db3555",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a87581b3fe7d3964ce5977d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵～呵呵！大小姐般的高傲笑声响彻亮相圈。\n修得了各种礼节的黄金船，\n已然化身为无比高贵的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f230d311ba4717b93e0df72a659312d61eb59a5cc8131bf8c9c3b95ebf1ffcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffb566662cf2514bf1834b9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "阻挡在她眼前的是荣进闪耀。\n为了胜利及关键字，\n黄金船即将翩然起舞──不对，是起跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43921c77d44fb98b0e7d3ac49a08267afad99e49054aff90b354b81519a0ffa0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2469588c6debbe88d12f6cbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向天皇赏（春）",
      "source_fingerprint": "787a30dcdda7188675e08b67055e274860a6c1346bc76e36d7243b3c8364986b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37d1bbb1f978b1d27cd717b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”是非常重要的大奖赛。\n黄金船与东瀛佐敦斗志高昂，\n誓言这次真的要赢过对方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b0d116ef9d0c02e9355ffbaaaa8a2989233975fdf6bacd988ebfa9ba6809030",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ecbb589752fe51e301d726",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在这个时候──训练员听见了耳熟的声音。\n然而始终找不到声音的主人是谁。\n疑问！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2334f506ec0e515d9b4eba725f36f7cfccc08a0ec1f02dbec6ee0e2d469002f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af9401cec546597560514b3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向宝冢纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "4743315d92bef0a1d3815aad5f8b1374f193f12e0416639bccc69a7a0dc88f06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:858ca32117e7726e78c17ec1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天要参加“天皇赏（秋）”。\n面对这次的大舞台，\n黄金船终于拿出了秘密武器。",
      "source_fingerprint": "407eeafaf23ded3e30e8aa175abe0190918a74bc5e2cfedecda4e726498fbbed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e88cc0701dbc01301faa8cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "传说中的“很痛！好痛！超级痛！”\n捣蛋三宝一应俱全，塞满伊贺栗的海胆。\n就用这招金一下☆把对手都打趴吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbf0cc9baf5ae11f3d558b880f6472f44496eebd30f35cb1921430ce0063f0d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c10e802c058cb6f64ba0d3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这种危险物品当然被训练员没收了，\n黄金船只能堂堂正正地与同样要参赛的\n东瀛佐敦一决胜负。好险哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "455d0aa1650e6645dea6ce3130fc07db27ecf53275ed66037d03fc3a14d43a67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00c8b0c99fb36028a64f3c62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向天皇赏（秋）",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd583fd839f6680a57f75e09880ff12f48e50ac7beeab6d01036df8eff7ff5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d38d13ea0688f81d4f48241a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”开始前，\n黄金船开始回顾至今的人生，\n并思考着今天的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b71727511c3c8a389acc95e54646ac04ee9832167c88ae80930259775f25e55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1c5b6e95dfb729086cf4e67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跨越高耸的山脉，成功出海！\n黄金船一划动船桨，谁也挡不住。\n这个事实，无论参加什么比赛都不会变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e7626aa547bc04debcf9c6c3972cbf3e12b44a192e7dade287af9ddd0e74664",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c044255293aab06c4169cd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天要与几度交手的劲敌们一较高下。\n闪耀系列赛最后一场竞赛\n终于要开始了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f410ee3ee41b539c1783587145fd2de4ca545b025ad980e498965b6d5f433ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df053d795bd975fddb25667e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007416.json",
