    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21cf448a5365e105658c81cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f49a3e0212cf8d2069154f4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船发挥强大的大豆之力，\n展现出强而有力的跑法。搜以搜以搜以搜以！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16002aab84403e86b1ad074cb1188f585853f673c1328ef51be569736fc0014",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd491583c61dad4762d29655",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03990d08c13a8141bee95b6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船想要参加更热血的竞赛。\n趁现在多多摄取蛋白质，\n下次在“希望锦标”夺得胜利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3efd091b9120beecac8c6b0b702772dea51804340655d8318aa9dad08cc163d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aa8c300bf0f5d57a2e1a0e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・胡乱前进",
      "source_fingerprint": "952b2f96e268e19d0e48fe379cc3fd6cc44dd8dc9d5e110759fe55914cb40c14",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e2e584c62b485c85de59aab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "称霸了名为“希望锦标”的大海后，\n黄金船迷失了该挑战的目标。\n难道她已经没有地方可以宣泄斗争心了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d07076c616629e543b2f379cfafa1ec05b7128718a60ffa24f3cf05362aa4192",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3326c1872f93e249e6c7816f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不对，还有可以拼命的地方。学会怎么制作\n便当里的绿色锯齿装饰，扛下日本饮食界吧！\n可是这样真的好吗，黄金船！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fe819e88e221d25634d5917a8c3623b9e585f46264391966603f13d6da140b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a1e16176caed20851cf06d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这样的她面前，续・秘传之书出现了。\n黄金船得知了通往伊甸园的下一步，\n于是燃起斗志准备挑战经典级的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8f0c420d2ee7167dcc17bd3c4bb20e7dff2c277f18842f8cd0b7f393034faa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bff84ec144850c19e6c106a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "希望S结束后・迈向伊甸园之路",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc444a943fd5a9358ab8bdab64517a85f8265a40972049ba4a7e3c866d496026",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afe4fda066349e16f6226890",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船在“皋月赏”留下好成绩，\n成功帮四月报了一箭之仇，\n还表示明年会继续参加“皋月赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ceaf705a340ef565793df6711b72c2c77b84d764a5ab5c865d8290707e79f99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1906018d3864f1ca07c7d5c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是黄金船并不知道，\n她明年已经没办法参加“皋月赏”了……\n即使如此，还是努力前进吧，黄金船──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b9ea2180dea0e6bfd590382192f6c63421daa0bd17bfdae389282118628d273",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de2aa79a6a78714545ecbe28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・为四月报仇",
      "source_fingerprint": "e09eb52397ac115dd20743068744caa9e6766fec9961421957f5664f3c7cdb07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:495e789bbf378295a7c9622d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "放轻松战术真是惊人，黄金船的表现绝佳！\n然而这次她却完全失去斗争心了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7f69b9838a5c9d31321721a956a497d69ed014055ad2f1d381fa84551bacbd1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d4931a8fc270cc496e74288",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在她差点开始经营农场时──\n荣进闪耀提出挑战，\n要与她在“有马纪念”一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2220784034526509cb2d0ad054c59126d0bc58735b70e5c5a2449d9ebeca164b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3542d376154d09d66fba787",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且现在迎战就送新的秘传之书，\n简直就像电视购物一样超划算。\n黄金船，此刻复活！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98b0b4dd1fb7bd6e532ec9f2d6d57628f5d2e7ee6f2cf5221248cf7c50f3cf3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca2fe89626b29b26987c626",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・通往伊甸园的线索",
      "source_fingerprint": "b45c11305b1b4aef44cd2f220baf8ed83675fdd82e7703b01abdffbca3b5be3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80b77213b09a55ae7787da01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船在“有马纪念”与荣进闪耀对决。\n她漂亮地拿下胜利，并挥舞着大大的渔旗。\n依照约定，她获得了新的秘传之书。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2e923a03af64e18005040061a6d6a9fc5356476b128641e23e65e777fc1f84a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82d595f067f200e46618c7ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "书上记载着伊甸园位在海底，\n只要与强者一战并收集四个关键字就能抵达。\n这本书也太可疑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b844d29925952cbb6a5a81ebf3c34dc1fa98c8c57a897fe61d092ea856c983f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c917a19ba6f977c651e308",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秘传之书的作者＆出处至今仍旧成谜。\n然而黄金船只能不断前进。\n伊甸园就在等着你……应该吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c5e76da9b3d4115bee6af9ca0e0102033c6dda5d37f08f6776e301958eb688f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a80cc83a11c7f561330e7fc5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・收集关键字吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0208d5a8d4727e289fefd2e2afc4eb6ad736f8ef80890e5364fd631c68197c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7968763ad9156afb529be368",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船展现足以剥开海胆的气势，\n顺利从荣进闪耀手上\n得到了第一个关键字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1406a2fc94ca61f7e0939e6752b2871c40b025fc5f6660e67384ea9483f84a8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:319a5c8737116b99f1d06ff1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来黄金船与东瀛佐敦巧遇，\n为了最后一块甜点互看不顺眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be3a53a92cc1d8ddb95e5eb2f326c871e6209a9c1d4fafa82241669d3fa325b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007422.json",
      "json_path": [
