    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ebe966e7d04432b8b387e22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船以热血狂赞士的气势\n漂亮地赢过了东瀛佐敦。\n顺便还拿到了新的关键字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad469b7ea96a79e1161b904f784386a0e83bb79a5f5421b38f576665843bea41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
