      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8f7d7c348fc64c6524df05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人约定好，下次要在更大的舞台对决。\n然而关键字与发送人──\n有关于伊甸园的问题仍旧谜团重重。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba6fa83e4108654658b1339d685605d8efb56de7dda2719b0b4dae597feb363",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
